      "content": "acetaminophen usually doesn't do much for my tooth pain tho. i feel like since i'm already taking the omeprazole every day it's basically protecting my stomach anyway right? like wont the omeprazole just neutralize the effect of the ibuprofen if it tries to irritate my stomach? i really just need the ibuprofen so i can sleep.",
