      "content": "i mean i hear you but i really dont have time to go to a doctor or anything right now. its just a toothache. if i just take a small dose like 200mg or 400mg once before bed, is that really gonna cause an ulcer or something? i feel like it's a pretty low dose, surely the omeprazole can handle that much without a problem. it shouldn't be that risky for just one night.",
